Status and scope

Christopher Dodd approved version 1.0 as Vespera's software licensing
policy. It applies to authorized official copies expressly released
under these terms. Making source visible grants no additional
permission to use, modify, or distribute that source. Existing
separate licenses and statutory rights continue to apply. Owner
