6. Termination

To the extent permitted by law, the permissions under this license end
if you materially breach its terms and fail to cure the breach within
30 days after written notice. On termination, stop using the proprietary
software and remove copies under your control except where retention is
required or permitted by law. Your rights in independent work and
third-party components are unaffected. Ownership, disclaimers, and
liability limits survive termination to the extent permitted by law.

7. Warranty and liability

To the extent permitted by applicable law, Vespera is provided as is and
as available, without express or implied warranties, including
merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and noninfringement.
To that same extent, the Vespera rights holders are not liable for
